id=gms_millet_guard
name=Millet Guard
version=2.0.4
versionCode=204
author=E3N
summary=Configurable HyperOS Millet/Greeze no-restrict guard
description=Keeps user-selected apps in MILLET_NO_RESTRICT_APP while preserving unrelated entries. Includes Xiaomi GMS limiter handling, path-aware/event-assisted FCM reconnect recovery, and race-safe stale-lock self-healing.
